{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "status": "published",
  "chapterId": "shibu-v002",
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "sentence-shibu-v002-p32-u1-v1",
      "text": "何仲举是营道人。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "a32b20dceab7282f61fb138b407aeb4b6070ad58875765a6f64e957db9df0c12",
      "originalEnd": 8,
      "paragraphId": "shibu-v002-p32",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 0,
      "originalSha256": "18d681cb5b01b4bee5061083e2c27a13f7ac254ec8c85912da1edd7e04979cdf",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "364",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "1c69d3ef2d2e4c12d68f4d6f6d4a2e33eed060fa1060152553c408ab3812b5c7",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-shibu-v002-p32-u2-v1",
      "text": "他容貌美好，十三岁时就才智出众，远超同龄人。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "4761cff5a5525963357e9a9e8346bd19fda5911dca3b1d8a8d98384350fc0b37",
      "originalEnd": 20,
      "paragraphId": "shibu-v002-p32",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 8,
      "originalSha256": "18d681cb5b01b4bee5061083e2c27a13f7ac254ec8c85912da1edd7e04979cdf",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "364",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "1c69d3ef2d2e4c12d68f4d6f6d4a2e33eed060fa1060152553c408ab3812b5c7",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-shibu-v002-p32-u3-v1",
      "text": "当时家境贫穷，没有按期限缴纳赋税。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "260e855811b77a5e560bfea289b8f48a0ed48e40c33f88123d1d170e925f414c",
      "originalEnd": 30,
      "paragraphId": "shibu-v002-p32",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 20,
      "originalSha256": "18d681cb5b01b4bee5061083e2c27a13f7ac254ec8c85912da1edd7e04979cdf",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "364",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "1c69d3ef2d2e4c12d68f4d6f6d4a2e33eed060fa1060152553c408ab3812b5c7",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-shibu-v002-p32-u4-v1",
      "text": "营道县令李皋很恼怒，让他戴枷入狱，准备鞭打。有人对李皋说：“这孩子虽然出身乡野，却能作诗，往往片刻就写成，希望县令仔细考察他。”",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "1f54c34b5aa0e95385a2cd1bf10aaff82ae77f97d1c823a70d1022eb8bd8a25a",
      "originalEnd": 82,
      "paragraphId": "shibu-v002-p32",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 30,
      "originalSha256": "18d681cb5b01b4bee5061083e2c27a13f7ac254ec8c85912da1edd7e04979cdf",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "364",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "1c69d3ef2d2e4c12d68f4d6f6d4a2e33eed060fa1060152553c408ab3812b5c7",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-shibu-v002-p32-u5-v1",
      "text": "李皋听说，立即召来问：“知道你有文才，而且敏捷。对于今天这件事，你若能不作修改，写一篇自述，我就宽免你。”",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "4b9c54d148962ac4785a77bcd7894faf2a8c9ce26c27b51a7e35c35757ec0df5",
      "originalEnd": 125,
      "paragraphId": "shibu-v002-p32",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 82,
      "originalSha256": "18d681cb5b01b4bee5061083e2c27a13f7ac254ec8c85912da1edd7e04979cdf",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "364",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "1c69d3ef2d2e4c12d68f4d6f6d4a2e33eed060fa1060152553c408ab3812b5c7",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-shibu-v002-p32-u6-v1",
      "text": "何仲举提笔写道：“我如美玉，却被送进监牢；离开家门，来戴木枷。”",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "f02cf959e5197d2e1ef9903b425856be33367975e5fe011209afb469136120c5",
      "originalEnd": 146,
      "paragraphId": "shibu-v002-p32",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 125,
      "originalSha256": "18d681cb5b01b4bee5061083e2c27a13f7ac254ec8c85912da1edd7e04979cdf",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "364",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "1c69d3ef2d2e4c12d68f4d6f6d4a2e33eed060fa1060152553c408ab3812b5c7",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-shibu-v002-p32-u7-v1",
      "text": "“可怜两片木板，竟夹住了一枝花。”",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "90d618aba77160cc7653171fcc2e0c4b7e495dd448fcfbc688606368e50f19b5",
      "originalEnd": 159,
      "paragraphId": "shibu-v002-p32",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 146,
      "originalSha256": "18d681cb5b01b4bee5061083e2c27a13f7ac254ec8c85912da1edd7e04979cdf",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "364",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "1c69d3ef2d2e4c12d68f4d6f6d4a2e33eed060fa1060152553c408ab3812b5c7",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-shibu-v002-p32-u8-v1",
      "text": "李皋十分惊讶，亲自为他解枷，请到厅上，以平等的礼节相待。从此何仲举开始专心求学。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "c32d03cb14529a8ea4663d7f85a05d5aef000b12cc2742f19a2b0fc1b2994525",
      "originalEnd": 187,
      "paragraphId": "shibu-v002-p32",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 159,
      "originalSha256": "18d681cb5b01b4bee5061083e2c27a13f7ac254ec8c85912da1edd7e04979cdf",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "364",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "1c69d3ef2d2e4c12d68f4d6f6d4a2e33eed060fa1060152553c408ab3812b5c7",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-shibu-v002-p32-u9-v1",
      "text": "天成年间，他来到洛阳。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "607c69397af150d2f75440a8d47726d8b413b181a6f377af7d3c28abf9b86b90",
      "originalEnd": 194,
      "paragraphId": "shibu-v002-p32",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 187,
      "originalSha256": "18d681cb5b01b4bee5061083e2c27a13f7ac254ec8c85912da1edd7e04979cdf",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "364",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "1c69d3ef2d2e4c12d68f4d6f6d4a2e33eed060fa1060152553c408ab3812b5c7",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-shibu-v002-p32-u10-v1",
      "text": "当时秦王主管河南府，尤其尊重士人，何仲举与张杭、江文蔚都到他门下交游。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "ab349d33b64ba1a1b4c798820cbf4ae66b7f907054faf5323c21909121c0ffe1",
      "originalEnd": 220,
      "paragraphId": "shibu-v002-p32",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 194,
      "originalSha256": "18d681cb5b01b4bee5061083e2c27a13f7ac254ec8c85912da1edd7e04979cdf",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "364",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "1c69d3ef2d2e4c12d68f4d6f6d4a2e33eed060fa1060152553c408ab3812b5c7",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-shibu-v002-p32-u11-v1",
      "text": "后来推荐应试时，共推荐了几百人，唯独何仲举被视为最出众的人。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "f59fcc4a139f8d42f3bec0fa2ac1f58fc370d1e6b89df4a670240480df535c62",
      "originalEnd": 240,
      "paragraphId": "shibu-v002-p32",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 220,
      "originalSha256": "18d681cb5b01b4bee5061083e2c27a13f7ac254ec8c85912da1edd7e04979cdf",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "364",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "1c69d3ef2d2e4c12d68f4d6f6d4a2e33eed060fa1060152553c408ab3812b5c7",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-shibu-v002-p32-u12-v1",
      "text": "何仲举于是献诗说：“我写下的佳句刚刚脱手，仙府里的诸位神仙就都点头称许。”",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "750ae8b070f82715c96c60db9418be46235d044952ba165d871a7fc517c81bdf",
      "originalEnd": 265,
      "paragraphId": "shibu-v002-p32",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 240,
      "originalSha256": "18d681cb5b01b4bee5061083e2c27a13f7ac254ec8c85912da1edd7e04979cdf",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "364",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "1c69d3ef2d2e4c12d68f4d6f6d4a2e33eed060fa1060152553c408ab3812b5c7",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-shibu-v002-p32-u13-v1",
      "text": "秦王十分高兴，称赞不止，因此何仲举一次应试就考中了高等。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "16650cb3456306038528e82b6d679bdff4b4244222fd8658356017f7577ecc35",
      "originalEnd": 281,
      "paragraphId": "shibu-v002-p32",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 265,
      "originalSha256": "18d681cb5b01b4bee5061083e2c27a13f7ac254ec8c85912da1edd7e04979cdf",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "364",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "1c69d3ef2d2e4c12d68f4d6f6d4a2e33eed060fa1060152553c408ab3812b5c7",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-shibu-v002-p32-u14-v1",
      "text": "返乡时，恰逢文昭王马氏代行朝廷任命权，依唐太宗旧例，在天策府设置十八学士，以李皋为学士之首，又掌政权。何仲举自认为出自李皋门下，虽已在朝廷取得功名，侍奉李皋却从没有松懈。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "080e97650603aba3dca2edb4d71dd1413ce247428973edf998d7daf9f40b71ff",
      "originalEnd": 347,
      "paragraphId": "shibu-v002-p32",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 281,
      "originalSha256": "18d681cb5b01b4bee5061083e2c27a13f7ac254ec8c85912da1edd7e04979cdf",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "364",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "1c69d3ef2d2e4c12d68f4d6f6d4a2e33eed060fa1060152553c408ab3812b5c7",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-shibu-v002-p32-u15-v1",
      "text": "李皋感动高兴，不断引荐提携，不久何仲举就与他同列学士。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "8349dfba4381fa015a441d82d7c071af56da57ee0fcd4802fc51fc53e60df817",
      "originalEnd": 363,
      "paragraphId": "shibu-v002-p32",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 347,
      "originalSha256": "18d681cb5b01b4bee5061083e2c27a13f7ac254ec8c85912da1edd7e04979cdf",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "364",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "1c69d3ef2d2e4c12d68f4d6f6d4a2e33eed060fa1060152553c408ab3812b5c7",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-shibu-v002-p32-u16-v1",
      "text": "后来出任地方官，又做过全州、衡州刺史。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "69d9234a71ee4c6a7cb57b7f2041fe0a486079acb798061267af8b2ec710cf19",
      "originalEnd": 376,
      "paragraphId": "shibu-v002-p32",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 363,
      "originalSha256": "18d681cb5b01b4bee5061083e2c27a13f7ac254ec8c85912da1edd7e04979cdf",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "364",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "1c69d3ef2d2e4c12d68f4d6f6d4a2e33eed060fa1060152553c408ab3812b5c7",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-shibu-v002-p32-u17-v1",
      "text": "此前湖南诗人尤其多，最著名的有沈彬、廖凝、刘昭禹、尚颜、齐己、虚中等，而何仲举在他们之中，诗风尤其轻浅。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "3454f61fae6b2ddec191a82807ea71c5e58eca9fb62ca29345072b04fb934470",
      "originalEnd": 423,
      "paragraphId": "shibu-v002-p32",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 376,
      "originalSha256": "18d681cb5b01b4bee5061083e2c27a13f7ac254ec8c85912da1edd7e04979cdf",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "364",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "1c69d3ef2d2e4c12d68f4d6f6d4a2e33eed060fa1060152553c408ab3812b5c7",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-shibu-v002-p32-u18-v1",
      "text": "只有李皋独自赏识他，常当众吟他的《秋日晚望》：“高飞的鸟归向深远原野，树木像在迎接；浮云依傍斜阳，越过遥远山岭。”",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "f2c99745e6fe0a8dabea57b83a89005c085bb8e4e9e05c4833b7ae2af5489d09",
      "originalEnd": 463,
      "paragraphId": "shibu-v002-p32",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 423,
      "originalSha256": "18d681cb5b01b4bee5061083e2c27a13f7ac254ec8c85912da1edd7e04979cdf",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "364",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "1c69d3ef2d2e4c12d68f4d6f6d4a2e33eed060fa1060152553c408ab3812b5c7",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-shibu-v002-p32-u19-v1",
      "text": "李皋用脚叩地，叹道：“何仲举是诗人中高雅超逸的。诸位看得上吗？其余人暂且撇开，他是天地间难得的英才。”",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "ac9f20f2fa3539a1c2da8d6e9f2d116385eb6902b4014782f63f07c2b7c41db2",
      "originalEnd": 501,
      "paragraphId": "shibu-v002-p32",
      "reviewNotes": [
        "底本“舍其余奴嶽，乃間氣爾”字词疑有讹误，依上下文暂释，待校核。"
      ],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 463,
      "originalSha256": "18d681cb5b01b4bee5061083e2c27a13f7ac254ec8c85912da1edd7e04979cdf",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "364",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "1c69d3ef2d2e4c12d68f4d6f6d4a2e33eed060fa1060152553c408ab3812b5c7",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-shibu-v002-p32-u20-v1",
      "text": "所以何仲举感激李皋的赏识，终于奋发自强。论他的名声节操，也始终没有污点，议论的人认为李皋有识人的眼光。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "2f4477a08653e0f69b84d70eabd65953d41b05c2a9d40816f40ac87bb57ff1de",
      "originalEnd": 536,
      "paragraphId": "shibu-v002-p32",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 501,
      "originalSha256": "18d681cb5b01b4bee5061083e2c27a13f7ac254ec8c85912da1edd7e04979cdf",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "364",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "1c69d3ef2d2e4c12d68f4d6f6d4a2e33eed060fa1060152553c408ab3812b5c7",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    }
  ]
}
